OL,3,AArgentina drops investigation into
OL,4,APresident Milei over crypto fraud
OL,5,
OL,6,FA criminal investigation into Argentine
OL,7,FPresident Javier Milei and his sister's
OL,8,Flinks to a cryptocurrency scandal has
OL,9,Fbeen dropped.
OL,11,FThe case against Milei and his sister
OL,12,FKarina Milei was dismissed by federal
OL,13,Fjudge Marcelo Martinez de Giorgi at the
OL,14,Frequest of prosecutors, court records
OL,15,Fshow.
OL,17,FThe Argentinian president had denied
OL,18,Fpromoting the newly launched cryptocoin
OL,19,F$Libra, which collapsed shortly after
OL,20,Fhe mentioned it in a social media post
OL,21,Fin February 2025.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
