OL,3,AArgentina drops investigation into
OL,4,APresident Milei over crypto fraud
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said he had acted "in good faith"
OL,7,Fwhen the cryptocurrency rose in value
OL,8,Fbefore crashing and causing huge losses
OL,9,Ffor the majority of its investors.
OL,10,FMilei is yet to respond to news of the
OL,11,Fcase being dropped.
